  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h2 id=\"publish-stream-with-uas-tool\"><a href=\"#publish-stream-with-uas-tool\">Publish stream with UAS Tool.</a></h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "legacy",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Deploy App - MTX",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Open Deloy App MTX</li>\n<li>Select \"+ Add\"</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX - Start a stream 1",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Open UAS Tool dropdown</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6c688161563357e5.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2007
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX - Start a stream 2",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select \"Import settings to UAS Tool\"</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/86295a5913b3135d.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 1997
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "ATAK - Import Settings",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>\"Would you like to apply the configuration from an external source?\"</li>\n<li>Select \"Yes\"</li>\n<li>Navigate to UAS Tool -plugin</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/cd929600c74f69be.webp",
              "width": 2109,
              "height": 994
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "ATAK - UAS Tool Streaming 1",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select your drone with the \"Play\" button</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ba41b55607516e35.webp",
              "width": 2106,
              "height": 995
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "ATAK - UAS Tool Streaming 2",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>To stream select the \"Rench\" button for settings</li>\n<li>Press the \"((Play))\" button to stream</li>\n<li>You should get a \"Broadcast started\" notification</li>\n<li>To end the stream press the \"((Play))\" button again</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/07df05ce5332df04.webp",
              "width": 2106,
              "height": 995
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "You now know how to stream",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>You can close this guide.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Once you have started the stream, continue to the section <a href=\"/doc/9c3d844b-ebb7-453c-9d30-7bab0891f66e\">Watch Stream</a></p>"
    }
  ]
